      "statement_id": "final:P6",
      "status": "partial",
      "checked_scope": "Actual finite-coefficient formal exponential substitution, its chain rule and negative-product identity; recursively constructed unique R=X exp(R); exact inverse substitution R exp(-R)=X; all-power Lagrange coefficients derived through the differential recurrence, including diagonal and k=1 cases. Exact marked Borel rescaling, formal fixed-point uniqueness, inverse factor exp(1), all formal forest coefficients, positivity and zero constant. Finite polynomial approximations prove actual Borel coefficient summability and total mass at most one.",
